sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser
    participant AuthCtrl as Auth<br/>Controller
    participant AuthSvc as Auth<br/>Service
    participant EmailService as Email/OTP<br/>Service
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Browser,DB: REGISTRATION FLOW
    Browser->>AuthCtrl: POST /register (email, password, profile)
    AuthCtrl->>AuthSvc: validate input + password policy
    AuthSvc->>DB: ensure email uniqueness
    AuthSvc->>DB: create user + hash password
    AuthSvc->>DB: create OTP for email verification
    AuthSvc->>EmailService: send OTP email
    EmailService-->>AuthSvc: OTP queued/sent
    AuthCtrl-->>Browser: 201 register success + verify required

    Note over Browser,DB: LOGIN FLOW
    Browser->>AuthCtrl: POST /login (email, password)
    AuthCtrl->>DB: verify credentials
    AuthCtrl->>AuthSvc: generate JWT + refresh token
    AuthSvc-->>AuthCtrl: return tokens + expiry
    AuthCtrl-->>Browser: 200 login success

    Note over Browser,DB: PASSWORD RESET FLOW
    Browser->>AuthCtrl: POST /forgot-password (email)
    AuthCtrl->>AuthSvc: issue OTP + expiry
    AuthSvc->>EmailService: send reset OTP email
    EmailService-->>AuthSvc: OTP sent
    AuthCtrl-->>Browser: 200 OTP sent
